file tools/fixtures/s/standing_equipment_scope_rank.sh recovered -- cost x (1 - touch_rate) per map row, three gates at zero
file tools/fixtures/s/scope_match.sh recovered -- the map matcher written once, sourced by runner and ranking
file tools/fixtures/i/index_shelf_repair.sh recovered, and first resident on the fault the recovery itself made
file construction/ITINERARY.md the recovery account, the nib at HEAD's parent, 26 bytes under bound
