scope one Earth lap -- two parked laps recovered from the dead-letter box, stash_record closed on metal at zero
status GREEN -- scope_rank 56 behaviors, index_row_bound 24, tame_style_check bans clean, stash_record verdict=ok, the row free on xy at `20260907.045528`
recommend keep-going -- the recovered ranking names the four costliest unmapped guards and I hold their fresh costs; ahead of them sits the ledger nobody reads, whose one recorded reading measures the door that cannot pay while the door that does goes unrecorded.
